    "time_sublinear": true,
    "sublinear_basis": "Comparison value is k x the k=1 window P50. The window IS the sentence, and the sentence grows with k, so a k=8 window costs more than the k=1 window this figure uses \u2014 the unbounded cost is therefore UNDERSTATED and the check is conservative (it is harder to pass than a same-k comparison would be). Stated because the same growth is why `enriched` can fall as k rises: at larger k, fewer of the more-expensive windows fit inside the budget.",
